    * #013 "Plant propagation" "See class 0130."
      * #0130 "Plant propagation" "This class includes the production of all vegetative planting materials including cuttings, suckers and seedlings for direct plant propagation or to create plant grafting stock into which selected scion is grafted for eventual planting to produce crops."
    * #014 "Animal production" "This group includes raising (farming) and breeding of all animals, except aquatic animals."
      * #0141 "Raising of cattle and buffaloes" """
